uirements in your inquiry.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes are offered?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Brown and Black, with source size labels 35-40. This listing covers the single-shoe version. Please provide quantities for each color and size; measurements and international size conversions are confirmed for the order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How do the boots close?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Actual source photos show front lacing and an inner-side zipper. Review the pictured opening, toe and sole shape for your assortment.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity or customization requirements with your color-size mix. Feasibility, charges, packing or logo options and any applicable minimums are confirmed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Is ready stock or a dispatch date guaranteed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>No ready-stock or fixed dispatch promise is made. Send your quantities, destination and requested dispatch date; per-size availability, payment and packing terms are confirmed for your inquiry.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative prices are USD 13.44 for 2-49 pairs, USD 12.54 for 50-99 pairs and USD 11.65 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on the color-size mix, packing and agreed order terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>